<title>ESTONIA: HOIU SAYS NO OFFICIAL MERGER TALKS.</title>
<headline>HOIU SAYS NO OFFICIAL MERGER TALKS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoiupank said on Friday that it was not in official merger negotiations with Tallinna Pank .</p>
<p>&quot;Hoiupank has not started official merger talks with Tallinna Pank,&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bank was responding to a report in Friday's edition of the Aripaev business newspaper.</p>
<p>Aripaev, quoting its own sources, said on that Hoiupank's owners had given the bank's chairman Olari Taal authority to hold merger talks with Tallinna Pank.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newspaper, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
